<title>USA: General Growth says buys Arizona mall.</title>
<headline>General Growth says buys Arizona mall.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Growth Properties Inc said it acquired Park Mall, a regional shopping mall in Tucson, Ariz., for roughly $50 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>The property is the 47th regional mall in which General Growth has acquired ownership since becoming a publicly traded real estate investment trust in April 1993, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
